1.  DGEX DOWN-SCALING (NET=DGEX, RUN=DGEX
Additional jobs are needed to extend SREF GEFS look-alike files from 90-192 forecast hours 

The following prep jobs are triggered once the GEFS 21 member sig files thru 192 forecast hours are available  
(by arount +5:30 hours after cycle time)
==============================================================================
ECF PREP JOB: 
~/smartinit.v3.2.4/ecf/jsref_gefs2sref.ecf   (mpmd job)
    JOBS  
    ../jobs/JSREF_WRFGFSPREP  ---> Create individual GEFS member files interpolated to SREF grids
    ../jobs/JSREF_GEFS2SREF     --->  Create SREF ensemble product files from interpolated GEFS members.
Also
../jobs/JDGEX_NAM2DGEX  --> Interpolate NAM 78 hour native grid parent forecast files  
                            to DGEX Conus grid (185) for conus dgex downscaling.

   SCRIPTS
    ../scripts/exsref_wrf_gfsprep.sh.ecf
    ../scripts/exsref_gefs2sref.sh.ecf
   ../scripts exsref_enspost4GEFS.sh.ecf
   /nwprod/sref.v6.1.1/ush/sref_prep_sig2pgb.sh  (not modified, use this script in the SREF NETwork.

  SOURCE
 ../sorc/sref_ens_gen.fd

These jobs and scripts perform the same tasks (with the same names) that are
currently run as part of the SREF system through fhr=87.
