Once the jsref_gefs2sref.ecf ecf job is complete, the smartinit system (JDGEX_SMINIT) can be run with
export RUNTYP=dgex_ak   for alaska grid downscaling at cycles 00/12 UTC  (forecast hours 84-->192)
export RUNTYP=dgex_cs   for conus grid downscaling at cycles 06/18 UTC    (forecast hours 78-->192)

